======================================================================
[ SuperSploit Pro ] APK SAST Scanner
======================================================================
Description:
  Static Application Security Testing (SAST) GUI for Android APKs.
  Integrates apktool for 1-click dynamic decompilation of raw .apk files
  and analyzes Smali (including multidex), XML, and resources for:
    - Hardcoded AWS/API Secrets & JWTs
    - Weak Cryptography (MD5, AES/ECB, DES) across 1500-char context windows
    - Insecure Manifest & networkSecurityConfig (Cleartext traffic, User-Cert trust)
    - Exported components (Mapped directly to their underlying .smali paths)

Usage:
  apk-sast
